Field Type Required Default Purpose <code>type</code> String No <code>"button"</code> Button input type <code>key</code> Key name or array of key names Yes — Input or combined inputs <p>If <code>type</code> is omitted, it defaults to <code>"button"</code>:</p> <pre><code>{ "key": "A" }
</code></pre> <p>You can also specify <code>"type": "button"</code> explicitly. A single key can use either form:</p> <pre><code>{ "type": "button", "key": "A" }
</code></pre> <pre><code>{ "type": "button", "key": ["A"] }
</code></pre> <p>Multiple keys combine their inputs:</p> <pre><code>{ "type": "button", "key": ["A", "B"] }
</code></pre>
